<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How DeskKaki earns money through affiliate links."><article>
<h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
<p>DeskKaki is reader-supported. Some links on this site are affiliate links, which may include links to Shopee, Lazada, Amazon.sg, Involve Asia and individual retailers. If you click one and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission. <strong>You pay the same price</strong>; the retailer pays us.</p>
<p>Commissions help cover the cost of running the site. They do not influence which products we include or how we rank them. We include products we think are worth considering whether or not they pay a commission, and some links on this site earn nothing.</p>
<p>Affiliate links are marked with <code>rel="sponsored"</code>. Prices and availability are accurate as of the date shown in each article and can change at any time; the retailer's page is the final word.</p>
<p>We are not paid to write reviews, and we don't accept free products in exchange for coverage. If that ever changes for a specific article, we'll say so clearly at the top of it.</p>
</article></Base>
